flowchart TD
    accTitle: Document Approval Workflow
    accDescr: A basic document review and approval flowchart

    A[Submit Document] --> B{Review Required?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Assign Reviewer]
    B -- No --> F[Auto-Approve]
    C --> D[Review Document]
    D --> E{Approved?}
    E -- Yes --> F
    E -- No --> G[Return for Revision]
    G --> A
    F --> H([Done])
